@startuml F5.19-D03-atualizar-estado
title F5.19-D03 — Atualizar estado da tarefa
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TaskController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Mover / Concluir
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /tasks/{id}\n{ estado }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE estado
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: card na coluna

@enduml
